{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"ALSA-2026:36196","published":"2026-07-07T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-07-21T14:30:04.431257183Z","related":["CVE-2026-11610","CVE-2026-11774"],"summary":"Important: 389-ds-base security update","details":"389 Directory Server is an LDAP version 3 (LDAPv3) compliant server. The base packages include the Lightweight Directory Access Protocol (LDAP) server and command-line utilities for server administration.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * 389-ds-base: 389-ds-base: Heap buffer overflow in sasl_io_recv() via padded SASL UNBIND (CVE-2026-11610)\n  * 389-ds-base: 389-ds-base: integer overflow in SASL packet length bypasses size limit leading to heap buffer overflow (CVE-2026-11774)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"389-ds-base","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/389-ds-base"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.2.0-8.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:36196.json"}},{"package":{"name":"389-ds-base-bdb","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/389-ds-base-bdb"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.2.0-8.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:36196.json"}},{"package":{"name":"389-ds-base-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/389-ds-base-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.2.0-8.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:36196.json"}},{"package":{"name":"389-ds-base-libs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/